@startuml A2_03_component_rag_graph_simple
title Prerequisite Gateway (rag_graph) – Simplified View

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
}

rectangle "**Prerequisite Gateway**\nservices/rag_graph\nHost: **8102** (default\ncompose mapping)" as RAG_GRAPH {
  rectangle "HTTP API\n/health, /prereqs, /program" as API
}

database "Neo4j\n(curriculum graph)" as NEO4J
cloud "Agent Service\n(LangGraph tools)" as AGENT

API --> NEO4J : read prerequisites,\nprogram structure
AGENT --> API : course_prereqs,\nprogram_requirements

note right of RAG_GRAPH
**Role:** Thin read gateway over Neo4j
**Tech:** FastAPI + neo4j driver
**Data:** Loaded separately (e.g. scripts/load_curriculum_neo4j.py)
end note

@enduml
